{"format":1,"version":0,"generated_at":"2026-09-26T20:33:24.162Z","exam":{"slug":"jamb","name":"JAMB"},"subject":{"slug":"mathematics","name":"Mathematics","display_name":"Mathematics"},"topics":[],"papers":[{"id":-1,"year":2025,"title":"Mathematics sample questions","duration_minutes":null,"items":[{"id":-12,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>What is 12 × 5?</p>","options":{"A":"50","B":"60","C":"65","D":"72"},"answer":"B","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>12 × 5 = 60.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>12 times 5 na 60.</p>"},{"id":-13,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>What is 3/4 + 1/4?</p>","options":{"A":"1/2","B":"3/4","C":"1","D":"4/8"},"answer":"C","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>The bottom numbers match, so add the tops: 4/4 = 1.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>The bottom numbers dey same, so add the top: 4/4 = 1.</p>"},{"id":-14,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>What is 15% of 200?</p>","options":{"A":"15","B":"30","C":"20","D":"45"},"answer":"B","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>15% of 200 = 0.15 × 200 = 30.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>15% of 200 na 0.15 × 200 = 30.</p>"},{"id":-15,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>Solve 2x + 3 = 11.</p>","options":{"A":"3","B":"4","C":"5","D":"7"},"answer":"B","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>Take away 3: 2x = 8. Divide by 2: x = 4.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>Comot 3: 2x = 8. Divide by 2: x = 4.</p>"},{"id":-16,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>A rectangle is 8 cm long and 5 cm wide. What is its area?</p>","options":{"A":"13 cm²","B":"26 cm²","C":"40 cm²","D":"45 cm²"},"answer":"C","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>Area = length × width = 8 × 5 = 40.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>Area na length times width = 8 × 5 = 40.</p>"},{"id":-17,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>Which of these is a prime number?</p>","options":{"A":"15","B":"21","C":"13","D":"27"},"answer":"C","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>13 can only be divided by 1 and itself.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>13 only dey divide by 1 and itself.</p>"},{"id":-18,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>What is 5<sup>2</sup>?</p>","options":{"A":"10","B":"25","C":"7","D":"52"},"answer":"B","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>5<sup>2</sup> means 5 × 5 = 25.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>5<sup>2</sup> mean 5 × 5 = 25.</p>"},{"id":-19,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>What is the average of 4, 6, 8 and 10?</p>","options":{"A":"6","B":"7","C":"8","D":"28"},"answer":"B","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>Add them: 28. Divide by 4: 7.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>Add dem: 28. Divide by 4: 7.</p>"},{"id":-20,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>What is the value of \\( \\sqrt{81} \\)?</p>","options":{"A":"7","B":"8","C":"9","D":"18"},"answer":"C","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>9 × 9 = 81, so the square root of 81 is 9.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>9 × 9 = 81, so square root of 81 na 9.</p>"},{"id":-21,"type":"mcq","html":"<p>A pen costs ₦50. How much do 6 pens cost?</p>","options":{"A":"₦250","B":"₦300","C":"₦350","D":"₦56"},"answer":"B","marks":1,"topic_id":null,"explanation_en":"<p>6 × ₦50 = ₦300.</p>","explanation_pcm":"<p>6 × ₦50 = ₦300.</p>"}]}]}